# Openfund credentials. Every name here is declared in src/fund/credentials.py,
# which is the single source of truth (planning/PLAN.md section 6). A name added there
# and not here will fail tests/test_redaction.py.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
# Values are left empty on purpose: this file is a manifest, not a store.
#
# ONE FILE IS ENOUGH, AND A SECOND IS SUPPORTED. Fill every name below into .env
# and everything runs. If you also create .env.treasurer — gitignored by the same
# rule — the treasurer role reads that file instead, and only that file:
# src/fund/config.py's env_file_for() sends the treasurer to .env.treasurer when it
# exists and every other role to .env. Split this way, .env.treasurer holds
# SIGNING_KEY, BANKR_KEY_EXEC and the two RPC endpoints, and .env holds the rest,
# so the two keys that sign and spend are not in the file an analyst process reads.
# Either way the processes that sign and spend are started from an empty
# environment and load their own credentials (unit 4.12), and any command can be
# pointed at a particular file with --env-file.
#
# One Bankr account, three scoped keys (decision 2026-09-17; planning/PLAN.md
# sections 6 and 13). The separation is per-key toggles, not separate accounts:
# BANKR_KEY_READ and BANKR_LLM_KEY carry Read Only ON, and only BANKR_KEY_EXEC may
# transact. The analyst process must never hold BANKR_KEY_EXEC or SIGNING_KEY
# (planning/PLAN.md section 2 invariant 1).

# --- analyst process (read-only, no spend authority) ---

# Quotes and market data. Read-only, Agent API off.
BANKR_KEY_READ=

# Analyst and risk inference via the LLM gateway. Read Only ON, LLM Gateway ON.
# It can read the Wallet API too (findings F0.2.2). We send X-API-Key; Bearer
# also works (F0.2.1).
BANKR_LLM_KEY=

# --- both processes ---

# Chain 4663 RPC endpoints. Request timeout, fail loudly, no archive reads
# assumed anywhere. Testnet is 46630 and is for probes and drills only: it is
# never the source of a published mark or a booked fill.
RPC_4663_MAINNET=
RPC_4663_TESTNET=

# --- treasurer process only (the sole spend authority) ---

# The treasurer's swaps. Read-write, IP allowlist, low platform caps,
# Agent API off.
BANKR_KEY_EXEC=

# ed25519 private key for the decision-record envelope. The public key is
# published; this never leaves the treasurer process.
SIGNING_KEY=
